      "text": "2. DIFFERENCE\n     Signs have value only through opposition to other signs.\n     \"cat\" means what it does partly because it ≠ \"bat\", \"cut\", \"can\".\n     Meaning is RELATIONAL, not intrinsic."
    },
    {
